libfabric: count AMD GPUs in the plugin's topology

Teaches the libfabric topology to detect AMD GPUs next to NVIDIA GPUs and Neuron devices. It does nothing on a
Neuron host; 0005 was written on top of it upstream and does not apply without it.

Upstream: https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl/pull/1750 (merged; in v1.5.0, not in the release/1.5.0 branch the PyPI
  1.5.0 wheels are built from)
Tests: upstream's topology unit test (in this patch)

